OL,3,GNEWSAHope of Christmas reopening for
OL,4,Awall-collapse road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seafront road closed for more than
OL,7,Fthree years after a wall collapsed on
OL,8,Fto it is set to reopen before
OL,9,FChristmas.
OL,11,FBath Road in Ventnor has been shut for
OL,12,Fsafety reasons between the western
OL,13,Fesplanade and town centre since October
OL,14,F2023 with nearby property boundaries
OL,15,Funder monitoring.
OL,17,FThe council said the failed retaining
OL,18,Fwall was set to be rebuilt with the
OL,19,Froute in the town expected to reopen by
OL,20,Fthe end of the year, "subject to
OL,21,Fweather conditions and ongoing
OL,22,Fmonitoring results".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
